   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "**Notes / reminders**\n",
    "- If session dies, just re-run cells 1→3; outputs in Drive are safe.\n",
    "- For very long videos (>30 min), consider processing in chunks (e.g., 0-10 min, 10-20 min) and concatenating at the end with `ffmpeg -i part1 -i part2 -filter_complex concat`.\n",
    "- Face retouch is CPU-heavy; for 20-minute videos it may take 10–20 min in Colab. If you only need light smoothing, reduce `smooth` parameter or skip retouch and do it in CapCut (as you mentioned).\n",
    "- The `video_processor.py` file is complete and self-contained; you can import it in any Python environment with the dependencies installed."
   ]
